addon-unicode-graphemes.js

The browser bundle originates from @xterm/addon-unicode-graphemes 0.4.0,
the matching addon for xterm.js 6.0.0.
https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js/tree/6.0.0/addons/addon-unicode-graphemes
https://registry.npmjs.org/@xterm/addon-unicode-graphemes/-/addon-unicode-graphemes-0.4.0.tgz
Original lib/addon-unicode-graphemes.js SHA-256
8e7f926f4def5733a190b80cff5cbaa550404e143b0750962f7d756138203cb8

This distribution refreshes the addon's serialized property table. The
Unicode 15.1.0 inputs are GraphemeBreakProperty.txt, emoji-data.txt and
EastAsianWidth.txt in https://www.unicode.org/Public/15.1.0/ucd/.
Generate out-ts/uc-properties.ts with src/generate.js --typescript from
https://github.com/PerBothner/unicode-properties/tree/e4bdcb0fefff and
unicode-trie 2.0.0, with the three inputs in data/. Replace the npm
bundle's original base64 trieRaw value with the generated trieRaw value.
The unused source map reference is removed.

